<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Northstar Academy | School operations</title><script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script></head><body class="min-h-screen bg-slate-950 text-white"><main class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-8 lg:px-10"><nav class="flex items-center justify-between"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><div class="grid h-10 w-10 place-items-center rounded-2xl bg-indigo-400 font-black text-slate-950">N</div><span class="font-semibold tracking-tight">Northstar Academy</span></div><a href="{{ url('/admin') }}" class="rounded-full border border-white/20 px-5 py-2 text-sm font-semibold transition hover:border-indigo-300 hover:bg-white/10">Open staff portal</a></nav><section class="grid gap-16 pb-24 pt-24 lg:grid-cols-[1.1fr_.9fr] lg:items-center"><div><p class="mb-5 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-indigo-300">School operations, in one calm place</p><h1 class="max-w-3xl text-5xl font-semibold leading-[1.02] tracking-tight sm:text-7xl">Make every school day feel <span class="text-indigo-300">lighter.</span></h1><p class="mt-8 max-w-xl text-lg leading-8 text-slate-300">Northstar gives administrators one clear view of learners, classrooms, attendance, teachers, and the announcements that keep every family aligned.</p><div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-4"><a href="{{ url('/admin') }}" class="rounded-full bg-indigo-400 px-6 py-3 font-semibold text-slate-950 transition hover:bg-indigo-300">Enter the dashboard</a><span class="rounded-full border border-white/15 px-6 py-3 text-slate-300">Built for the TALL stack</span></div></div><div class="rounded-[2rem] border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-5 shadow-2xl shadow-indigo-950/40"><div class="rounded-[1.5rem] bg-slate-900 p-6"><div class="mb-8 flex items-center justify-between"><div><p class="text-sm text-slate-400">Today at a glance</p><p class="mt-1 text-2xl font-semibold">Good morning, Avery</p></div><div class="rounded-xl bg-emerald-400/10 px-3 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-emerald-300">All systems clear</div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3"><div class="rounded-2xl bg-white/5 p-4"><p class="text-sm text-slate-400">Active students</p><p class="mt-2 text-3xl font-semibold">48</p><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-emerald-300">+6% this term</p></div><div class="rounded-2xl bg-white/5 p-4"><p class="text-sm text-slate-400">Attendance</p><p class="mt-2 text-3xl font-semibold">94.2%</p><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-indigo-300">Today so far</p></div><div class="col-span-2 rounded-2xl bg-indigo-400 p-5 text-slate-950"><p class="text-sm font-semibold">Next up</p><p class="mt-1 text-xl font-semibold">Family information evening</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-800/75">Thursday · Main hall · 18:00</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="grid gap-4 border-t border-white/10 py-10 text-sm text-slate-400 sm:grid-cols-3"><div><p class="font-semibold text-white">01 · People</p><p class="mt-2 leading-6">Keep every student, teacher, and guardian record current.</p></div><div><p class="font-semibold text-white">02 · Rhythm</p><p class="mt-2 leading-6">Record attendance in seconds and spot patterns early.</p></div><div><p class="font-semibold text-white">03 · Alignment</p><p class="mt-2 leading-6">Publish the right message to the right audience.</p></div></section></main></body></html>